            <p class="msc-section-kicker">MSC-GUIDE-033</p>
            <h3>How the Lightning Network Works</h3>
            <p>Follow Lightning from channel funding and commitment states through HTLC routing, revocation, liquidity, fees, watch requirements, implementation differences, and Bitcoin-enforced channel closure.</p>
            <ul class="msc-learn-page-meta"><li>Shallow</li><li>Explainer</li><li>14 to 17 minutes</li></ul>
            <p class="msc-learn-preview-note">Read guide remains inactive until publication and URL confirmation.</p>
