            <p class="msc-section-kicker">MSC-GUIDE-034</p>
            <h3>What Is Ark on Bitcoin?</h3>
            <p>Examine Ark and current Arkade architecture through VTXOs, operator-coordinated rounds, liquidity, expiry, unilateral exits, data retention, preconfirmation, and the project's alpha maturity.</p>
            <ul class="msc-learn-page-meta"><li>Deep</li><li>Technical Analysis</li><li>20 to 24 minutes</li></ul>
            <p class="msc-learn-preview-note">Read guide remains inactive until publication and URL confirmation.</p>
